  "body": [
    "A partnership with Zendesk will empower your business from the get-go. Be positioned to differentiate, grow your revenue, and expand in multiple markets.",
    "Build up business—reliably. Expand revenue, grow profits, and extend your reach in new markets.",
    "Enter into a trusted partnership. We support your sales engagements and marketing initiatives, and arm you with expert training.",
    "Our award-winning solutions give you an edge. Leverage them to create differentiated services and custom integrations that build market share.",
    "Choose the paths that fit your business. Sell, deploy, and build custom solutions with complementary programs—all designed with you in mind.",
    "Earn recurring revenues from your customers. Access bigger discounts and benefit from extra margin opportunities and incentives.",
    "Get rewarded for recommending Zendesk. Just refer your clients, and we’ll do the rest.",
    "Deploy solutions that transform your customer’s organization and deliver impressive results.",
    "Build an app, automation or integration, or connect data sources across your technology stack. Promote your app on the Zendesk Marketplace and become a Zendesk Technology Partner today.",
    "Our goal is for customers to onboard fast and stay forever. Ninety percent of Zendesk users take eight weeks or less to deploy, accelerating time to value.",
    "There’s opportunity ahead. Join us in building integrations and adding services that are force multipliers in growth markets.",
    "More than half of Zendesk customers use apps as part of their solution. On average, Marketplace apps generate over 33k installs every year.",
    "#1",
    "for Digital Customer Service",
    "< 8 weeks",
    "to deploy for 90% of Zendesk users",
    "33k",
    "new app installs on Marketplace every year",
    "Our partner ecosystem provides customer solutions, tailored for every need. Together, we’re building lifelong connections with customers.",
    "Technology partners expand the reach of Zendesk Suite to provide spot on solutions for specific industries and use cases.",
    "Solution providers help customers achieve their business goals, faster. They bring consulting and sales expertise, and deep implementation experience.",
    "Business process outsourcers leverage the Zendesk platform to deliver top notch customer experience services.",
    "Global strategic partners build practices that develop, design, and implement transformational customer experience strategies.",
